INFO  2026-04-13T13:53:01 +0ms service=decision-log taskID=tsk_d8714b3fe00164ZrVy6z5Pn1T7 key=naming_convention value=## File and code naming conventions
File naming:
  - React components: PascalCase (e.g., Button.tsx, Sidebar.tsx)
  - Non-component files: camelCase (e.g., designTokens.ts, main.tsx)
  - Config files: camelCase with dots (e.g., vite.config.ts, tailwind.config.js)

Type naming:
  - Interfaces: PascalCase with Props suffix for component props (e.g., ButtonProps, SidebarProps)
  - Type aliases: PascalCase (e.g., NavItem, DesignTokens)

Component naming:
  - React components: PascalCase (e.g., Button, ToggleSwitch, ProgressBar)
  - Props interfaces: {ComponentName}Props (e.g., ButtonProps)

Variable/function naming:
  - camelCase for variables and functions (e.g., tokens, defaultNavItems, onChange)
  - Constants: camelCase or UPPER_SNAKE_CASE for true constants

CSS/Tailwind classes:
  - Use Tailwind's kebab-case utility classes
  - Custom classes in index.css: kebab-case (e.g., .nav-item-active)

Export conventions:
  - Components: export default for main component
  - Types: export interface alongside component
  - Utils: export const for utilities phase=architect decision logged
